  "basis": "The independent visual notes confirm that the June sales bar ends exactly at the 200 mark, which is the position of the 'Average' dashed line. Therefore, June sales are exactly average, not below average. Neither option 'Route June to low-sales response' nor 'Route June to strong-sales response' is supported by the chart, as both require deviation from average. The only remaining public option is 'Keep June on normal sales monitoring', which is consistent with the observed data and the absence of any policy mandating escalation for average performance.",
  "option_label": "Keep June on normal sales monitoring"
}
